name: Timeline Channel
type: Channel
description: >
  External Coordination channel backed by one timeline and bound to one actor
  in the containing document. A feeder uses both bindings to determine whether
  a Timeline Entry is eligible through this channel. The same timeline may be
  bound to several channels, but one input entry must never produce duplicate
  logical delivery solely because several bindings match.

timeline:
  type: Coordination/Timeline
  schema:
    required: true
  description: >
    Timeline whose entries may be accepted through this channel.

actor:
  type: Coordination/Actor
  schema:
    required: true
  description: >
    Actor represented by this channel. A feeder matches this actor against the
    actor attributed on a candidate Timeline Entry.
